@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Use this page to detail your site's privacy policy.</p>

<p>
    We collect only the minimal information required to provide secure authentication, manage comments, and track aggregate
    article readership metrics to improve editorial coverage.
</p>
<p>
    NewsSphere utilizes secure HTTP-only cookies strictly for maintaining authenticated session states and preventing cross-site
    request forgery (CSRF/XSRF) through ASP.NET Core anti-forgery tokens. We do not sell user data or employ invasive third-party
    behavioral trackers.
</p>
<p>
    Every registered reader has the right to review, update, or request deletion of their account and submitted comments at any time.
</p>
